        <body>
            <div xml:id="d27">

                <pb facs="0116" n="56" xml:id="pg56"/>

                <head>27. Memorandum From the Vice Chairman of the Policy Planning Council
                        (Morgan) to the
                    President’s Special Assistant for National Security Affairs (Bundy)<anchor n="0" xml:id="d27-f1"
                    /></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName>Washington</placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1961-03-27">March 27,
                    1961</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <list subtype="subject" type="description">
                    <label>SUBJECT</label>
                    <item>Iran</item>
                </list>
                <p>I attach one copy each of two papers on Iran, prepared by the Department’s Bureau
                    of Near Eastern and South Asian Affairs, which Mr. McGhee suggests be discussed at lunch Tuesday, March 28.<anchor
                        n="1" xml:id="d27-f2"/></p>
                <p>The first of these papers, dated February 11, 1961, is a discussion of the
                    internal situation in Iran, while the second, dated March 20, 1961, addresses
                    itself to the problem of the urban middle class.</p>
                <p>I am distributing additional copies of these papers to the persons indicated
                        below.<anchor n="2" xml:id="d27-f3"/></p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#bold"
                    >GAM</hi></signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d27-a1.xml" xpointer="d27-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d27-a2.xml" xpointer="d27-a2"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d27-f1" n="0" type="source" xml:id="d27-f1-content">
