                    Files, Country Series, Iran, 3/21/61– 3/31/61. Secret.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f2" n="1" xml:id="d27-f2-content">
                <p>No record of the meeting has been found.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d27-f3" n="2" xml:id="d27-f3-content">
                <p>William Bundy in DOD/ISA and Robert Amory and Richard Bissell in CIA.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
